    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "Vishesh Mahendru is a visual designer based in India, working across brand identity, digital design, and 3D visualization."
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "He’s spent the last few years moving between packaging, web, and spatial work, building brand systems that stay consistent whether they end up on a shelf, a screen, or somewhere in between. Recent work spans agency websites, sports branding, and packaging design for consumer brands, with 3D visualization used where it strengthens the work rather than as the whole point of it."
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "Selected clients"
    },
    {
